{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "94435",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "You have done well, <name>. It was a small thing, but even small acts of service such as this may help strengthen our connection to the light.\n\nThe Dark Lady and many in her service mistrust us. Some even conspire against us, but we will visit their skepticism and fear with courage and righteousness. We will show them that we are members of the Forsaken and we are willing to do our part, be it large or small, to help our people prosper once again.\n\nTake this symbol, you will need it for what comes next."
    },
    {
      "id": "94436",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "So you'll help me, then? Good, good. I'll admit I'm not proud of resorting to... well, resorting to asking paladins for aid. The priests waved me away and you might be my friend's only chance.\n\nPlease, help me."
    },
    {
      "id": "94438",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "I'm... back? And saved by a <class> no less? I see you carry a Symbol of Life. I've not seen one of those since... well, since before the war when Lordaeron was a very different place. I can only assume you are here to help. Billmuth and I were sent here to scout out the scarlet activity here, and we found out that they are planning some kind of attack.\n\nIf you would be willing to help more, there may yet be more than you can do to help the Forsaken."
    },
    {
      "id": "94440",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "What news of Deathguard Falgan?"
    },
    {
      "id": "94440",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Thank you for saving my friend, <name>. I will take these plans back to my commander and we will give those crusaders a welcoming they won't forget.\n\nI know that many among our people mistrust you paladins, but it's clear to me that you are Forsaken through and through. I won't forget this, and I'll make sure others know of what you did here today."
    },
    {
      "id": "94441",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "The Symbol of Life is only able to be used by a <class> who is ready to make use of one of the light's greatest blessings. I'm proud to count you among us, and I now bestow upon you the gift of redemption. With this you will be able to resurrect your fallen companions. Use this new boon wisely.\n\nYou have done well for both the Forsaken as well as the paladins of Tyr's Watch. Any steps we can take to win the hearts and minds of our fellow Forsaken is well worth the effort. Go with the light, <name>."
    },
    {
      "id": "95314",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "I trust you did not get lost?"
    },
    {
      "id": "95314",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "You say there is evil in Shadowvale? I admit, I am not surprised. The forest folk were an odd lot, and they did not care for visitors. Some believe the Whispering Forest itself is cursed, and the elixir distilled from its roots carries that same curse...\n\n...but enough of superstition and rumors, <name>. Thank you for the elixirs. Here, take this as payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "95328",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Do you have something for me, <class>?"
    },
    {
      "id": "95328",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "What an interesting specimen. From underneath the Whispering Forest, you say? It's no secret that foul place is touched by the void.\n\nI welcome the opportunity to explore the mysteries of shadow, <class>. Allow me to offer you payment for what you've found."
    },
    {
      "id": "95803",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Why are you addressing me, <class>?"
    },
    {
      "id": "95803",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "I don't doubt Danitha's sincerity and desire to earn a place for your kind amongst the Forsaken. However, I suspect that this isn't the last time we'll see one of your brothers and sisters go mad and turn the light against their own people.\n\nThere may come a time when I decide that tolerating your misbegotten order is no longer in the best interests of the Forsaken. I suggest you continue to serve your people diligently.\n\nWe will be watching."
    },
    {
      "id": "96607",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "id": "96607",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "So now that we've learned the basics, why don't you go and learn a tradeskill from the trainers in the village nearby. They will also teach you how to create a camp fixture suitable to your new profession."
    },
    {
      "id": "96656",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "I'm not affiliated with the Scarlet Crusade, if you couldn't tell. I'm just an adventurer stopping by before my next venture into the wilderness.\n\nHey, you've got the look of an adventurer yourself. How would you like to learn about camping?"
    }
  ],
  "response": {
